  {
   "title": "STUNT INFUSED IMMERSION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Replicating the same bait and switch the film employs, IHC developed a 3-act narrative that played out across Colonial St (best known as Wisteria Lane), presenting both new scenarios and key movie scenes being shown from a different perspective.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Alongside our masterful partners Just Fix It Productions and 87NORTH (John Wick movies, Hobbs &amp; Shaw, Atomic Blonde), scripting, audio, casting, wardrobe and numerous fight sequences were all created from scratch to bring the event to life.</p>"
    },
    {
