  {
   "title": "TECHNICAL DESIGN",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Our set was transformed into a living, breathing neighborhood through cinematic lighting, props, and dramatic fog. The scene broke down into utter chaos and put our influencer guests face-to-face with a series of stunning choreographed action sequences, all coordinated to play out in a perfectly timed order.</p>",
     "right": "<p>The story narrative was pieced together from film audio and played through FM radio during the show, sync’d to the action through live showcalling. Due to COVID restrictions, all audio played inside guests’ cars.</p>"
    },
    {
