  {
   "title": "IN-WORLD ELEMENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Beyond the action, the scene was brought to life through a 25-person cast who filled out the neighborhood and kept the story (and vehicles) moving forward, all in-character.</p>",
     "right": "<p>We oversaw every aspect of the production to ensure a seamless experience, from entry to the enjoyment of the screening. We crafted Nextdoor-inspired invitations, neighborhood watch signs to guide traffic and custom kitty cat charm bracelets (an integral piece to the film’s pivotal scene) as gifts to all attendees.</p>"
