  {
   "title": "SCREENING PLUS UPS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>From a car-friendly photo moment from Tommy B to custom branding to booking DJ Ana Calderon, our team blended a multi-layered activation into one huge promotional weekend making sure that the drive-in screening had the same impact as the stunt itself.</p>",
     "right": "<p>IHC also invited top-tier talent and cultural influencers to attend, including Billie Eilish, Hannibal Buress, Viktoria Modesta and many more, to ensure additional social coverage.</p>"
    },
